cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or write about Nordpress, please cite it as below."
title: "Nordpress"
abstract: >-
  Nordpress is an open-source WordPress alternative written in TypeScript.
  It runs on Node.js with Next.js and PostgreSQL, keeps WordPress's concepts
  and APIs (posts, taxonomies, roles, hooks, shortcodes, permalinks and the
  /wp-json/wp/v2 REST API), imports WordPress sites, ports PHP plugins and
  themes, and has Claude built in.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: aleksandarsest
repository-code: "https://github.com/aleksandarsest/nordpress"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - wordpress alternative
  - wordpress migration
  - cms
  - typescript
  - nodejs
  - nextjs
  - postgresql
